message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "AIMS — AI system for Inference and Measurement in Science"
abstract: >-
  AIMS (AI system for Inference and Measurement in Science) is an
  uncertainty-aware, closed-loop AI experimentalist for cryogenic microwave
  impedance microscopy (MIM). It combines a 37-tool Model Context Protocol (MCP)
  server — Nanonis/Attocube hardware control, scan-image acquisition and
  processing, particle-filter stage centering, and gate-sweep data analysis —
  with agent loop prompts (navigation, measurement, discovery) and a discovery
  skill that performs Bayesian mechanism inference, converting experimental
  uncertainty into the next measurement or calculation.
type: software
